silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_02_per_entity_subdiagrams_concrete_anchors silm:hasExample "In 'PerEntitySubdiagramConcreteAnchors', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, ISO microchip 9000-0000-0042, scanned and recorded at intake; also, 4.7 kg, measured on 2026-02-14 on the clinic calibrated scale; also, the Felis catus / TSN 183798 lineage row imported from the ITIS sqlite cannon witness." .
